## Remote Daemon — Distribution ENABLED
## EPMD-less distribution over a pinned port (for SSH tunneling).
## Uses a custom EPMD module (EvoGit.EpmdDist) that doesn't require an external
## epmd process. The daemon listens on port 9000; SSH tunnels forward to it.
-start_epmd false
-epmd_module Elixir.EvoGit.EpmdDist
-dist_listen true
-kernel inet_dist_listen_min 9000 inet_dist_listen_max 9000

## Desktop Optimization Flags (same as desktop)
+sbwt none
+sbwtdcpu none
+sbwtdio none

## Shrink Pre-allocated Table Limits
+P 40000
+t 80000
